--
libstdc++ 13 <atomic>: std::atomic<int> was a conversion error (bin53),
the root cause being cpp11_using_declaration_conversion_function_member_typedef
(`using __base_type::operator __integral_type;'), and
__waiter_pool_base::_S_for (`uintptr_t(__addr)') was dropped
(cpp_functional_cast_through_typedef_reinterprets).  Both are fixed.  g++ 13
accepts this program, and it fails only its WRONG assertion.
